   330	The meeting was then turned over to Darin Buchalter, CEO of the Delta Consulting Group
   331	
   332	Qualifications and Scope of Engagement
   333	Mr. Buchalter described a thirty-six year career as a board advisor and expert witness in the real estate
   334	and construction industry, including testimony in federal courts and arbitral forums worldwide and
   335	before the Ninth Circuit. Delta Consulting Group has provided advisory services internationally for
   336	twenty-six years and employs 180 personnel, largely accounting, valuation and engineering
   337	professionals. He noted the firm's involvement with high-visibility sites in Washington, D.C., including
   338	Capitol Hill, the Senate and House office buildings and the Library of Congress, and a client relationship
   339	with the Architect of the Capitol spanning more than ten years.
   340	
   341	Delta was engaged to independently assess the construction program and identify the most effective
   342	path forward for the repair and renovation of the Center while balancing operations and mission. The
   343	analysis relied on the JLL 2026 Comprehensive Project Development Plan and the 2021 DLR
   344	Comprehensive Building Plan, supplemented by Delta's own site tours alongside on-site project
   345	managers, interviews with finance, programming and operations staff, and briefings with Board
   346	committees. Mr. Buchalter emphasized that Delta had no prior involvement with the Center and no
   347	preconceived notion as to the proper path forward.
   348	
   349	The Two Scenarios
   350	Delta evaluated each scenario against the priority of work, schedule impacts, capital cost against the
   351	fixed appropriation, operating expense implications, and the implications for the Center's long-term
   352	mission. Delta thinks about the project as “What is priority of Work” It’s a fixed appropriation, going to
   353	spend it on certain improvements. Question is What are operating Costs? Take into consideration long-
   354	term mission.
   355	
   356	Operate and partially renovate means continuing to operate main building. The REACH continues to
   357	operate under either scenario.
